<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia's BNDT bank reports '96 profits.</title>
<headline>Tunisia's BNDT bank reports '96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque Nationale de Developpement Touristique (BNDT) on Tuesday reported a 6.68 million dinars ($6.95 million) pre-tax profits for 1996, down from 9.58 million dinars in 1995.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank specialises in loans for the tourism sector. It has a capital of 30 million dinars.</p>
<p>BNDT share on the Tunis Stock Exchange was last priced 29 dinars. ($=1.04 dinar)</p>
</text>
